MAIN. THE CONTRACTOR SHALL INSTALL AND/OR MAINTAIN\nBARRICADES AS DETAILED ON THE DRAWINGS AND AS OUTLINED IN THE DEMOLITION/SITE CLEARING NOTES.\n\n19. SOD SHALL BE THE SPECIES AS CALLED FOR ON THE DRAWINGS. SOD SHALL BE WELL MATTED WITH HEAVY ROOT DEVELOPMENT\n\nAND FREE OF WEEDS, FUNGUS AND OTHER DISEASES.\n\n12.PAVER DIMENSIONS ARE NOMINAL. VERIFY ACTUAL PAVER DIMENSIONS PRIOR TO LAYOUT OF PAVER FIELDS.\n\n15.BALLED AND BURLAPPED PLANTS SHALL HAVE THE BURLAP, STRINGS, STRAPS AND WIRE CAGES REMOVED FROM THE TOP 1/3\n\nOF THE ROOT BALL.\n\n8. THE CONTRACTOR SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR AND BEAR ALL COSTS RELATED TO THE TESTING OF EXISTING SOILS, PREPARED\n\nPLANTING MIXES AND AMENDMENTS.\n\n9. REFER TO ARCHITECTURAL PLANS FOR ALL BUILDING DIMENSIONS.\n\n11.HARDSCAPE DIMENSIONS ARE FROM THE FACE AND/OR CENTERLINE OF THE OBJECT AT 90 DEGREE ANGLES UNLESS NOTED\nOTHERWISE. ALL RADII AND CURVES ARE TO HAVE SMOOTH AND CONTINUOUS TRANSITIONS WITHOUT ABRUPT CHANGES OR\n\nBENDS.\n\nB\n\n14. ALL LANDSCAPE AREAS SHALL BE DRAGGED WITH A DRAG MAT TO BLEND IN SMALL IMPERFECTIONS AND ROUND OFF AND SHARP\n\nEDGES.\n\n7. THE CONTRACTOR SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR OBTAINING ALL PERMITS REQUIRED FOR THIS WORK PRIOR TO THE START OF\n\nCONSTRUCTION.\n\nHARDSCAPE NOTES\n\n13/01/2026 5:59:25 p. m.\n\n2. PLANTING SHALL NOT COMMENCE UNTIL IRRIGATION HAS BEEN INSTALLED AND IS OPERATIONAL. TREES MAY BE INSTALLED\nPRIOR TO THE INSTALLATION OF IRRIGATION PROVIDED THAT A HAND WATERING SCHEDULE IS SUBMITTED TO AND APPROVED\n\nBY THE OWNERS REPRESENTATIVE.\n\nAPPROXIMATE\n\nMH\n\nARCHITECT\n\nMIN\n\nBALLED AND BURLAPPED\n\nMISC\n\nBOTTOM OF CURB\n\nN\n\nBACK OF CURB\n\nNIC\n\nBOTTOM OF RAMP\n\nNO\n\nBOTTOM OF STEP\n\nNOM\n\nBACK OF WALL\n\nOC\n\nCALIPER\n\nOD\n\nCATCH BASIN\n\nPC\n\nCUBIC FEET\n\nPE\n\nCAST IN PLACE\n\nPI\n\nCENTER LINE\n\nPL\n\nCLEARANCE\n\nPSB\n\nCENTIMETER\n\nPT\n\nCLEAN OUT\n\nPVC\n\nCONTINUOUS\n\nQTY\n\nCUBIC YARD\n\nR\n\nDEGREE\n\nREF\n\nDEMOLISH, DEMOLITION\n\nREINF\n\nDIAMETER